{"ticker":"DPZ","updated":"2026-10-23T22:52:59Z","profile":{"longName":"Domino's Pizza, Inc.","shortName":"Domino's Pizza Inc","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Restaurants","country":"United States","website":"https://biz.dominos.com","fullTimeEmployees":6200,"marketCap":10316531712,"trailingPE":17.278788,"forwardPE":15.200808,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.0362813,"pegRatio":1.44,"targetMeanPrice":356.48148,"targetHighPrice":425.0,"targetLowPrice":257.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":27,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.034,"earningsGrowth":0.127,"grossMargins":0.28874,"operatingMargins":0.2041,"profitMargins":0.12028,"totalRevenue":5066358784,"beta":0.951,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":442.35,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":282.0,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.51},"summary":"Domino's Pizza, Inc. operates as a pizza company worldwide. The company operates through three segments: U.S. Stores, International Franchise, and Supply Chain. It offers pizzas under the Domino's brand name through company-owned and franchised stores. The company also provides bread products, wings, boneless chicken, pastas, oven-baked sandwiches, soft drink products and desserts. In addition, it offers parmesan stuffed crust pizza; spicy chicken bacon ranch specialty pizza; and garlic, and cinnamon bread bites, as well as croissant, chocolate volcano, and chicken burst pizzas. Domino's Pizza, Inc. was founded in 1960 and is based in Ann Arbor, Michigan.","summary_zh":"Domino's Pizza, Inc. 是一家全球披薩公司。該公司透過三個部門運作：美國商店、國際特許經營和供應鏈。它透過公司自營店和特許經營店提供達美樂品牌的披薩。該公司還提供麵包產品、雞翅、去骨雞肉、義大利麵、烤箱烘烤的三明治、軟性飲料產品和甜點。此外，它還提供帕瑪森皮披薩；辣雞培根牧場特色披薩；大蒜和肉桂麵包，還有羊角麵包、巧克力火山和炸雞披薩。 Domino's Pizza, Inc. 成立於 1960 年，總部位於密西根州安娜堡。","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"餐廳","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":451.22,"h":463.08,"l":450.6,"c":460.66,"v":817700},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":460.24,"h":461.15,"l":444.47,"c":451.22,"v":754000},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":452.84,"h":465.6,"l":451.2,"c":452.55,"v":855600},{"t":"20